[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あったかい飲み物、あったかい飲み物……っと……\r\nえーっと、お茶に……コーヒー……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00013",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん、寒い時に体をあたためるなら何がいいかな……\r\nお、しょうが入りミルクティーなんてのもあるぞ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……\r\nプ、プロデューサーさん……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？\r\n……おお、真乃！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまん！\r\n撮影、もしかして休憩に入ったか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bgm": "015",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、さっき休憩に入りました\r\nなのでプロデューサーさんにお伝えしなきゃって思って──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、真剣な表情で自販機とにらめっこしていたので、\r\n声をかけていいかちょっと迷ってしまいました……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……いや、本当にすまん。今日は外での撮影だから、\r\nあったかい飲み物を用意しようと思ってな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "休憩入ってすぐ渡せるようにと思ってたんだけど……\r\nせっかくだから、飲み物は真乃が選んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……\r\nありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、なに\r\n遠慮しないで好きなの言ってくれていいからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ……えっと……\r\nあ……しょうが入りのミルクティーがありますっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "体がポカポカになりそうですっ\r\nでも、それならココアも良さそうですし……ほわぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なんならふたつ買ってもいいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "い、いえ、ちゃんとひとつに決めますっ\r\nえっと──あっ…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの、プロデューサーさんっ\r\n私、これがいいです──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "se": "0180",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "se": "0158",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "bgm": "002",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はぁ\r\n甘酒を飲むと落ち着くな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ、プロデューサーさん\r\n初詣の時も同じことを言っていました",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういえば、そうだったかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの時も、こうしてふたりで甘酒飲んだよな\r\nその後、鳩にも挨拶して……あれは初めての体験だった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私は一緒に挨拶ができて、\r\nとっても嬉しかったですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに喜んでもらえたなら\r\n来年もご一緒させてもらおうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n鳩さんもきっと喜びますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、\r\n来年も同じ神社へお参りに行った方がいいかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\nまた、偶然お会いできるでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……でも、私も同じ神社に\r\nお参りに行こうって思っているんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……実は、初詣の時のお願い事が、\r\n最近どんどん叶っているなって思って、驚いていて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……\r\n真乃はどんなことをお願いしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……『今年もアイドル頑張れますように』\r\n『アイドルとしてちょっぴり自信が持てますように……』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……今年はたくさんお願いしちゃって……\r\n欲張りでした……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいんじゃないかな\r\nお願いがたくさんあるって素敵なことだと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（その願いごとが『叶った』って自覚があるのは\r\nいいことだ）",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（このまま、\r\nどんどん自信を持って頑張っていってほしいな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、いえ……実は、プロデューサーさんを見かけた時は\r\n１回目のお参りをした後だったなって思い出して……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、じゃあ俺と会った時は２回目か\r\nあの時はなんてお願いしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……え？　えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "その……『プロデューサーさんのお願いごとが\r\n叶いますように』……って",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだったのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの時の、俺の願いは……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "なんだか、とっても真剣な表情だったので\r\n私も、何かできたらなって思って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（『みんながアイドルとして\r\nさらに輝けますように……』、だった……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "余計なお世話でしたでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まさか、そんなことないよ\r\nむしろ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の願いごと、真乃のおかげで叶ったみたいだ\r\nありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お礼に俺も、真乃の願いがもっと叶うよう\r\n協力するからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ……プロデューサーさんにそう言ってもらえると\r\nすごく、頼もしいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの、それじゃあ、プロデューサーさん\r\nもう明けまして、ではないですけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006110260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "改めまして、これからもよろしくお願いしますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100611/2001006110260"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]